flowchart TD
    A["代理批量产出选项（Agents generate in volume）"] --> B{"『差不多』就收下？（Accept as good enough?）"}
    B -- "是" --> C["自满收下：代理的夸奖会拉平品味（Complacency flattens taste）"]
    B -- "否：追问好在哪" --> D["刻意校准：看好例、研坏例、说出为什么（Calibrate on exemplars and failures）"]
    C -. "重建评价习惯" .-> D
    D --> E["对『仅仅合格』保持不满（Dissatisfied with adequate）"]
    E --> F{"觉得不对却说不出？（Feels off, can't say why?）"}
    F -- "是" --> G["放慢，把它命名：品味正在成形（Name it; taste forming）"]
    G --> D
    F -- "能判断了" --> H["编辑成为稀缺职能：会选的人更值钱（Editing is the scarce function）"]
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class D,E,G core;
    class B,F gate;
    class A,C,H out;
